  "title": "Liquidia Corporation Announces Inclusion in the S&P SmallCap 600® Index",
  "summary": "MORRISVILLE, N.C., June 08, 2026 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- Liquidia Corporation (Nasdaq: LQDA), a biopharmaceutical company driven by science and compassion to revolutionize care for patients with challenging respiratory and vascular diseases, announced today that it will be added to the S&P SmallCap",
